From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8350: vote the QUP interconnect paths

Add the qup-virt provider, and give every GENI I2C and SPI engine its
qup-core, qup-config and qup-memory paths and every UART its qup-core and
qup-config paths, as sm8250 and sm8450 do. QUP0 and QUP2 reach DDR
through aggre2_noc, QUP1 through aggre1_noc.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350.dtsi |  246 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 246 insertions(+)


